PROBLEM: Integer Production Scheduling

MAXIMIZE
55 BatchA + 48 BatchB + 72 BatchC + 35 BatchD

SUBJECT TO
4 BatchA + 3 BatchB + 6 BatchC + 2 BatchD <= 180
5 BatchA + 4 BatchB + 7 BatchC + 3 BatchD <= 220
3 BatchA + 5 BatchB + 4 BatchC + 2 BatchD <= 170
2 BatchA + 2 BatchB + 3 BatchC + BatchD <= 100
BatchA >= 5
BatchC >= 3

INTEGER
BatchA BatchB BatchC BatchD